      "problem": "What is the domain of the function $h(x)={x}^{2}-2x-3?$",
      "worked_solution": "A quadratic function is defined for all real numbers.\n\nTherefore, the domain of $h(x)$ is $x\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$",
