      "problem": "What is the domain of the function $f(x)=10(x+4)^{2}+5?$",
      "worked_solution": "A quadratic function is defined for all real numbers.\n\nTherefore, the domain of $f(x)$ is $x\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$",
